---
import Badge from '@/components/ui/Badge.astro';
import { Globe, ShoppingBag, Smartphone, ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="cara-kerja" class="py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <Badge variant="secondary" class="mb-3">Sederhana & Efisien</Badge>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Hanya 3 Langkah untuk Mulai Jualan
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground">
        Alur transaksi terintegrasi dari link web pembeli langsung masuk ke genggaman aplikasi Anda.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card relative">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <Globe class="size-7" />
        </div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-muted text-muted-foreground mb-3">
          Langkah 1
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Buka Toko & Dapatkan Subdomain</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Daftarkan tokomu dalam 2 menit. Dapatkan link eksklusif seperti <span class="font-medium text-foreground">namatoko.larisken.id</span> untuk dibagikan di bio Instagram, TikTok, dan Google Maps.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card relative">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <ShoppingBag class="size-7" />
        </div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-muted text-muted-foreground mb-3">
          Langkah 2
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Pelanggan Checkout di Web</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Pembeli membuka link web tokomu, memilih menu, sistem menghitung ongkir secara otomatis, dan pembeli membayar langsung ke rekening atau QRIS tokomu.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card relative">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <Smartphone class="size-7" />
        </div>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-muted text-muted-foreground mb-3">
          Langkah 3
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-2">Order Masuk Aplikasi & Tracing Order</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Login ke Aplikasi Toko Larisken di HP Anda, notifikasi langsung berbunyi saat order masuk. Anda tinggal klik terima dan proses pesanan, pembeli pun bisa melakukan tracing status ordernya.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

